        "TileImage": "$($repository a326595c-bf01-431a-b8c4-abccadc8a2ad).Image",
        "Description": "Rolf Hirschmuller has been trying to get rid of the drug infestation in his club by threatening and killing drug buyers that make their way past security.\rRolf has been targeting the addicts in Club Holle by having his staff lure unsuspecting drug users to their death to prevent the club from getting investigated from another overdose.\rUnfortunately for Rolf, the rapid string of killings seemed to do the opposite. Eliminate Rolf and his anti-drug vigilantes and get Club Holle shut down for good",
